<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Wage Survey</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td { padding: 8px 0; }
  .header { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row > div { width: 48%; }
  .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
  .notes { font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 20px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="max-width: 150px; height: auto;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 10px 0;">WYOMING DEPARTMENT OF EMPLOYMENT</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 5px;">2022 PREVAILING WAGE SURVEY</h2>
  </div>
  <p>Reporting Period: <span data-field="reporting_period">{{ reporting_period }}</span></p>
  <p>PLEASE RETURN THIS SURVEY AS SOON AS POSSIBLE AND NO LATER THAN NOVEMBER 10, 2022.</p>
  <p>Return your completed survey in the postage paid and addressed envelope included in this packet.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Step 1 Address Information (this ensures that accurate information is used for future surveys)</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <p>Firm Name: <span data-field="firm_name">{{ firm_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Number of Employees in Firm: <span data-field="number_of_employees">{{ number_of_employees }}</span></p>
      <p>Mailing Address: <span data-field="mailing_address">{{ mailing_address }}</span></p>
      <p>Phone: (<span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>) Fax: (<span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span>)</p>
      <p>Completed By (Please Print Name): <span data-field="completed_by_name">{{ completed_by_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Title: <span data-field="title">{{ title }}</span> E-Mail: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>City: <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span> State: <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> Zip: <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Step 2</div>
  <p>Did your firm <span data-field="did_firm_perform_residential_work">{{ did_firm_perform_residential_work }}</span> perform residential work in Wyoming during the past year? <input type="radio" name="residential_work" value="yes"> YES <input type="radio" name="residential_work" value="no"> NO</p>
  <p>Did your firm <span data-field="did_firm_use_subcontractor">{{ did_firm_use_subcontractor }}</span> use sub-contracted labor to perform work? <input type="radio" name="subcontractor_work" value="yes"> YES <input type="radio" name="subcontractor_work" value="no"> NO</p>
  <p>If you responded NO to both of the question, proceed to Step 3.</p>
  <p>If you responded YES to either of the questions, do NOT proceed, simply sign and return the survey.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Step 3</div>
  <p>Did your firm perform any non-residential construction work in Wyoming during the past year?</p>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> YES Check all that apply:</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Commercial (Non-Agriculture)</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Commercial (Agriculture)</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Industrial</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Public Building/Project</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Heavy/Highway</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Other (Please specify)</label>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">GO TO STEP 4.</div>

  <div class="section-title">Step 3 (Cont.)</div>
  <p>NO Please let us know why your firm did not do any construction work in Wyoming during the past year:</p>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> The firm is closed.</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> The firm had no employees other than owners or corporate officers.</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> The firm had no work in Wyoming during the past year.</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> The firm subcontracted all work.</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> The firm does not do construction work. (Please write a brief description of the type of work the firm does).</label>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>ONLY if you responded NO in Step 3, do NOT proceed, simply sign and return the survey.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
      <div>Signature</div>
      <div>Date</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Step 4</div>
  <p>Is your firm party to any collective bargaining agreements? If so, list all that apply in the space provided below.</p>
  <div style="height: 150px; border: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 10px;"></div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">GO TO STEP 5 (On the back of this sheet)</div>

  <div class="notes">
    If you have any questions regarding the purpose of this survey or how to complete it, please contact Elijah Bryant, Center for Business and Economic Analysis at the University of Wyoming, <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>. Phone: (<span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span>).
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.9em;">PW Survey, Dept. of Economics, Dept. 3985, 1000 E. University Ave., Laramie, WY 82071</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="max-width: 150px; height: auto;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 10px 0;">WYOMING DEPARTMENT OF EMPLOYMENT</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 5px;">2022 PREVAILING WAGE SURVEY</h2>
  </div>
  <p>Reporting Period: <span data-field="reporting_period_2">{{ reporting_period_2 }}</span> as described on the <span data-field="instruction_sheet">{{ instruction_sheet }}</span>.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Step 5 Remember:</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Only report journeymen or fully qualified and trained workers</li>
    <li>Trainers or apprentices should not be included</li>
    <li>Foremen, administrative, supervisory, or management staff should not be included</li>
  </ul>
  <p>See included sample sheet for instructions on how to complete the information below.</p>

  <div class="section-title">OCCUPATION OF EMPLOYEE</div>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <div style="width: 20%;">OCCUPATION CODE REQUIRED</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">OCCUPATION TITLE</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">NUMBER OF WORKERS</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">WAGES</div>
  </div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 25%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 25%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for i in range(20) %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="occupation_code_{{ i }}">{{ 'CODE' }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="occupation_title_{{ i }}">{{ 'TITLE' }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="number_of_workers_{{ i }}">{{ 'COUNT' }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="wage_rate_{{ i }}">{{ 'RATE' }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Notes:</div>
  <p>
    <span data-field="note_1">{{ note_1 }}</span> If more than one employee, then combine hours. Please include overtime hours.
  </p>
  <p>
    <span data-field="note_2">{{ note_2 }}</span> Exclude production bonuses, safety awards, or overtime pay.
  </p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">Thank You For Your Cooperation!</div>
</div>

